  40:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/scb/cy_scb_uart.h **** *   * Standard UART
  41:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\drivers/peripheral/scb/cy_scb_uart.h **** *   * Multi-processor mode
